<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AAA rating to L-Bank dual samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA rating to L-Bank dual samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday that it had assigned an AAA rating to Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemberg's (L-Bank) 30 billion yen 4.8 percent yen/Australian dollar dual currency samurai bonds due December 30, 1998.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
